;PALASM Design Description
; pds2v test: structural errors.  Nothing may be written.
; EXPECT-EXIT: 1
; EXPECT: error: polarity in the declaration (/NEG) is not supported
; EXPECT: error: unsupported storage type 'LATCHED'
; EXPECT: error: STRING must be
; EXPECT: error: unexpected character '['
; EXPECT: error: Y: expression ends unexpectedly
; EXPECT: error: UNDECL is not declared as PIN or NODE
; EXPECT: error: Z: undeclared signal NOPE
; EXPECT: error: Z is driven twice
; EXPECT: error: R is declared REGISTERED; use ':='
; EXPECT: error: registered R2 has no .CLKF
; EXPECT: error: R3.CLKF must be a single clock pin name
; EXPECT: error: Z.FOO: extension .FOO not supported
; EXPECT: error: NODE N cannot have .TRST
; EXPECT: error: C.CLKF on a combinatorial signal
; EXPECT: error: W.RSTF given but W has no equation
; EXPECT: error: V: 'IF': IF/CASE syntax is not supported
; EXPECT: pds2v: 16 error(s), nothing written

CHIP     BADSYN  MACH111
PIN  5   CLK
PIN  4   A
PIN  26  B
PIN  2   /NEG
PIN  3   L     LATCHED
STRING   BROKEN   no quotes
PIN  40  Y
PIN  41  Z
PIN  42  R     REGISTERED
PIN  43  R2    REGISTERED
PIN  44  R3    REGISTERED
PIN  1   C     COMBINATORIAL
PIN  8   W
PIN  9   V
NODE ?   N     COMBINATORIAL

EQUATIONS
Y = A *
Z = A * NOPE
Z = B
UNDECL = A
R = A
R2 := A
R3 := B
R3.CLKF = CLK * A
Z.FOO = A
N = A
N.TRST = B
C = A
C.CLKF = CLK
W.RSTF = A
V = IF A
V[0] = B
